flowchart TB
  Legacy["Legacy Next + DynamoDB/S3"]
  Stabilize["Stabilize + characterize"]
  Boundary["Server auth/data/media boundary"]
  Import["Repeatable PostgreSQL import"]
  Shadow["Shadow read + reconcile"]
  Pilot["Flagged workspace pilot"]
  Cutover["Target read/publication cutover"]
  Retire["Revoke and retire legacy"]
  Rollback["Legacy server adapter / prior artifact"]

  Legacy --> Stabilize
  Stabilize --> Boundary
  Boundary --> Import
  Import --> Shadow
  Shadow --> Pilot
  Pilot --> Cutover
  Cutover --> Retire
  Pilot -. failure .-> Rollback
  Cutover -. failure .-> Rollback
